The Pusher subscription cleanup in the useEffect (lines 29-38) does not clean up the ConciergeReasoningStore subscription properly. When the component unmounts, only the Pusher channel is unsubscribed, but the reasoning history remains in the store.

**Fix**: Clear the reasoning history for this report when unmounting:

```typescript
